OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright day with a mix of
OL,6,Fsunny spells and occasionally heavy
OL,7,Fshowers, however the showers are
OL,8,Fexpected to become less frequent later
OL,9,Fin the afternoon. Occasionally fresh
OL,10,Fsouthwesterly winds turning
OL,11,Fnorthwesterly.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FScattered showers this
OL,14,Fevening and overnight with some long
OL,15,Fclear spells developing. Feeling
OL,16,Frather chilly with occasionally fresh
OL,17,Fnorthwesterly winds easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
