OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA few early showers,
OL,6,Fotherwise dry with some good spells of
OL,7,Fsunshine. Cloud increasing later with
OL,8,Frain reaching Orkney by evening and
OL,9,FShetland by midnight. Freshening
OL,10,Fsoutherly through the evening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FOvernight
OL,13,Fheavy rain soon clearing then sunny
OL,14,Fspells and blustery showers Friday,
OL,15,Fthe showers becoming heavier, more
OL,16,Ffrequent Saturday, with northwesterly
OL,17,Fgales for Orkney. Mainly dry and
OL,18,Fbright Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
